    <item>
      <title>摩根大通的现金养护人在债券市场混乱中搬家</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/jpmorgan-s-cash-hoarding-man-makes-move-amid-bond-market-mayhem</link>
      <description><![CDATA[J.P. Morgan Asset Management的债券投资组合经理Bill Eigen在过去三年中一直在ho积现金，终于开始部署其中一些资金，因为信贷市场显示出裂缝的迹象。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/jpmorgan-s-cash-hoarding-man-makes-move-amid-bond-market-mayhem</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 18:41:34 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>关税市场溃败使芝加哥的养老金损失10亿美元</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/tariff-fueled-market-rout-cost-chicago-s-pensions-1-billion</link>
      <description><![CDATA[据估计，在唐纳德·特朗普总统的关税政策引起的市场溃败中估计，芝加哥养老金基金损失了近10亿美元，这是对城市退休计划的打击，这是美国所有主要城市资助的最低资金。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/tariff-fueled-market-rout-cost-chicago-s-pensions-1-billion</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 18:40:02 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>需要豁免“阶段”关税：卡特里娜·达德利</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-14/need-to-phase-in-tariffs-with-exemptions-dudley-video</link>
      <description><![CDATA[富兰克林·邓普顿投资公司（Franklin Templeton Investments）全球股票投资组合经理卡特里娜·达德利（Katrina Dudley）表示，特朗普对关税的灵活性对企业来说是个好消息，豁免可能有助于解决重新培训制造业的漫长交付时间。 （来源：彭博）]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2025-04-14/need-to-phase-in-tariffs-with-exemptions-dudley-video</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 18:28:11 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>“成长或死亡”开车110岁的芝加哥经纪人到Stonex销售</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/stonex-buys-chicago-brokerage-r-j-o-brien-for-900-million</link>
      <description><![CDATA[R.J. O’Brien＆amp; Associates于1914年末开始生活，当时是John V. McCarthy＆amp;公司在芝加哥的街道上在购物车上出售黄油和鸡蛋。在下个世纪，该公司扩展到经纪人，清理了从伦敦到迪拜再到新加坡的一系列期货和金融工具。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/stonex-buys-chicago-brokerage-r-j-o-brien-for-900-million</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 15:12:26 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
